@startuml architecture_mvc
title Architecture MVC en 3 couches (§9)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Navigateur" as B
package "Présentation" {
  [public/index.php\n(front controller)] as FC
  [app/Router.php] as R
  [app/Controller/*] as C
  [app/View/*] as V
}
package "Métier" {
  [app/Repository/*] as REP
  [app/Model/PanierSession] as PS
  [app/Security/*] as SEC
}
package "Données" {
  [StoreInterface] as SI
  [JsonStore] as JS
  [SqlStore\n(PDO)] as SQL
  [data/minishop/*.json] as FS
  database "MySQL\nprocédures + triggers" as DB
}
B --> FC : HTTP
FC --> R
R --> C
C --> REP
C --> V
C --> SEC
C --> PS
REP --> SI
SI <|.. JS
SI <|.. SQL
JS --> FS
SQL --> DB
note bottom of SI : le contrôleur ne connaît que l'interface :\nbasculer JSON ⇄ MySQL ne change ni les vues ni les tests
@enduml
